WEBVTT

00:00:02.763 --> 00:00:04.937
Bridget, Gristle,
perfect timing!

00:00:05.072 --> 00:00:06.236
We would've been here sooner,

00:00:06.372 --> 00:00:08.504
but we had to make
a pickup first.

00:00:09.910 --> 00:00:10.874
Viva! You showed up.

00:00:11.010 --> 00:00:12.441
Yeah, I know, right?

00:00:12.577 --> 00:00:14.344
I'm kind of freaking out
a little bit.

00:00:14.479 --> 00:00:16.776
You've got
a really brave sister.

00:00:16.912 --> 00:00:20.252
Actually, I've got
two really brave sisters.

00:00:22.488 --> 00:00:25.317
Poppy, I'm really sorry
about before.

00:00:25.452 --> 00:00:26.957
It's okay.

00:00:27.093 --> 00:00:28.554
Our story's complicated.

00:00:28.689 --> 00:00:30.291
Who cares if it's not perfect?

00:00:30.427 --> 00:00:32.594
As long as we're together.

00:00:33.995 --> 00:00:35.967
I should've come with you.
I was just...

00:00:36.102 --> 00:00:37.199
Did you just braid my hair?

00:00:37.335 --> 00:00:38.532
Yeah. I learned from the best.

00:00:38.668 --> 00:00:41.040
Oh, my gosh,
it is so fantastamazing!

00:00:41.175 --> 00:00:43.842
Oh, no.
Hold on to your cupcakes!

00:00:43.977 --> 00:00:46.043
Hang on tight, Grissy.

00:00:46.178 --> 00:00:47.741
Bridgey, what are you doing?

00:00:49.314 --> 00:00:53.880
BRIDGET:
Best honeymoon ever!

00:00:54.015 --> 00:00:56.949
♪ If the top's
where you want to stay ♪

00:00:57.085 --> 00:01:00.355
♪ You gotta work hard
to make it look easy ♪

00:01:00.490 --> 00:01:02.522
♪ You gotta live fast... ♪

00:01:02.657 --> 00:01:04.526
Go get 'em, awesome sisters!

00:01:04.662 --> 00:01:07.729
♪ If you want to be
as famous as me ♪

00:01:07.864 --> 00:01:11.002
♪ You gotta work, gotta work,
gotta work ♪

00:01:11.138 --> 00:01:12.832
♪ You gotta work hard ♪

00:01:14.709 --> 00:01:15.568
(yells)

00:01:15.703 --> 00:01:16.941
♪ You gotta live fast... ♪

00:01:17.077 --> 00:01:18.843
- Ow!
- (grunting)

00:01:18.979 --> 00:01:20.273
Viva la Viva, baby.

00:01:20.409 --> 00:01:21.409
You guys all right?

00:01:21.544 --> 00:01:23.110
Yes, but we're not done yet.

00:01:23.246 --> 00:01:25.515
Let's bro!

00:01:26.952 --> 00:01:28.087
♪ Fame ♪

00:01:28.222 --> 00:01:32.258
♪ I'm gonna live forever ♪

00:01:32.393 --> 00:01:36.092
- ♪ Learn how to fly ♪
- ♪ High ♪

00:01:36.227 --> 00:01:37.824
(grunting, screaming)

00:01:37.959 --> 00:01:41.062
♪ If the top is
where you want to stay ♪

00:01:41.197 --> 00:01:42.763
♪ Fame ♪

00:01:44.034 --> 00:01:45.568
(grunts)

00:01:47.607 --> 00:01:49.676
- ♪ You gotta work, gotta work ♪
- Floyd!

00:01:49.811 --> 00:01:53.539
- ♪ Baby, remember my name... ♪
- ♪ Remember, remember ♪

00:01:53.674 --> 00:01:55.674
♪ Remember, remember ♪

00:01:55.809 --> 00:01:58.580
♪ Remember, remember, remember ♪

00:01:58.716 --> 00:02:01.449
♪ Remember,
remember, remember. ♪

00:02:01.585 --> 00:02:02.814
CROWD (chanting):
We want more!

00:02:02.950 --> 00:02:05.322
- We want more!
- VELVET: All right.

00:02:05.458 --> 00:02:08.591
- You guys want an encore?
- (cheering)

00:02:10.030 --> 00:02:11.760
Encore? Sis, come on.

00:02:11.895 --> 00:02:13.794
This one won't even last you
half a song.

00:02:13.930 --> 00:02:16.233
Let's just quit
while we're on top.

00:02:16.368 --> 00:02:19.701
Just sing, you beautiful idiot.

00:02:20.368 --> 00:02:22.675
(whirring)

00:02:22.811 --> 00:02:23.936
(groaning weakly)

00:02:25.044 --> 00:02:27.479
♪ Hey... ♪

00:02:27.615 --> 00:02:30.248
Floyd will never make it.
He's got nothing left.

00:02:30.383 --> 00:02:33.786
Guys, Poppy said
something earlier,

00:02:33.921 --> 00:02:35.080
and she was right.

00:02:35.215 --> 00:02:38.224
We don't have to be perfect
to be in harmony.

00:02:38.360 --> 00:02:42.688
We just have to be
as we are, together.

00:02:42.824 --> 00:02:45.093
We'll follow your lead, Branch.

00:02:45.228 --> 00:02:47.130
Here we go!

00:02:47.265 --> 00:02:49.034
(speakers power down)

00:02:49.169 --> 00:02:51.931
- What?
- Who did that?

00:02:52.874 --> 00:02:54.032
(giggles, snorts)

00:03:01.509 --> 00:03:03.148
Ugh. Come on!

00:03:03.284 --> 00:03:07.251
♪ It's some kind of love ♪

00:03:07.387 --> 00:03:11.215
♪ It's some kind of fire ♪

00:03:11.351 --> 00:03:14.093
- ♪ I'm already up ♪
- ♪ Ooh... ♪

00:03:14.228 --> 00:03:16.689
♪ But you lift me higher ♪

00:03:16.825 --> 00:03:19.329
♪ You know I'm not wrong ♪

00:03:19.465 --> 00:03:22.297
♪ You know I'm not lying ♪

00:03:22.433 --> 00:03:24.630
♪ We do it better ♪

00:03:24.765 --> 00:03:28.739
♪ We do it better, yeah ♪

00:03:28.875 --> 00:03:33.838
♪ And I don't mind
if the world spins faster ♪

00:03:33.973 --> 00:03:36.181
♪ The music's louder ♪

00:03:36.316 --> 00:03:38.683
♪ The waves get stronger ♪

00:03:38.818 --> 00:03:43.186
♪ I don't mind
if the world spins faster ♪

00:03:43.322 --> 00:03:45.183
♪ Faster, faster ♪

00:03:45.318 --> 00:03:48.453
♪ Just let me take you
to a better place ♪

00:03:48.588 --> 00:03:50.321
(crowd cheering)

00:03:50.457 --> 00:03:54.400
♪ I'm gonna make you
kiss the sky tonight ♪

00:03:54.535 --> 00:03:58.030
♪ Yeah, if you let me
show the way ♪

00:03:58.166 --> 00:04:02.607
♪ I'm so excited
to see you excited ♪

00:04:02.742 --> 00:04:04.674
♪ I'll take you
to a better place ♪

00:04:04.809 --> 00:04:06.875
♪ I'll take you to
a better place ♪

00:04:07.010 --> 00:04:10.712
♪ And, baby, you can love me
on the way ♪

00:04:10.847 --> 00:04:14.512
♪ We're flying up
to outer space ♪

00:04:14.647 --> 00:04:17.020
- ♪ I'm so excited ♪
- ♪ I'm so excited ♪

00:04:17.156 --> 00:04:20.120
- ♪ To see you excited, yeah ♪
- ♪ To see you excited ♪

00:04:20.255 --> 00:04:24.130
♪ I don't mind
if the world spins faster ♪

00:04:24.265 --> 00:04:26.231
♪ The music's louder ♪

00:04:26.366 --> 00:04:28.227
♪ The waves get stronger ♪

00:04:28.362 --> 00:04:32.567
♪ I don't mind
if the world spins faster ♪

00:04:32.702 --> 00:04:36.505
♪ Faster, faster, faster ♪

00:04:36.640 --> 00:04:40.876
- ♪ Yeah ♪
- (crackling)

00:04:41.012 --> 00:04:44.478
♪ Just let me take you
to a better place. ♪

00:04:44.613 --> 00:04:47.684
(explosive whooshing)

00:04:55.259 --> 00:04:58.090
♪ ♪

00:05:04.399 --> 00:05:05.867
Floyd.

00:05:06.701 --> 00:05:08.171
Come on, man, wake up.

00:05:08.306 --> 00:05:09.503
Wake up, Floyd.

00:05:09.638 --> 00:05:11.477
We need you, brother.

00:05:13.145 --> 00:05:14.179
Oh, no.

00:05:14.315 --> 00:05:16.808
I-I built the hideout, Floyd.

00:05:16.943 --> 00:05:19.848
Except the ten-story waterslide.

00:05:24.089 --> 00:05:25.320
But...

00:05:25.456 --> 00:05:27.188
how will we shower?

00:05:27.323 --> 00:05:28.623
Floyd.

00:05:28.759 --> 00:05:30.424
- Floyd? Floyd!
- (crowd cheering)

00:05:30.560 --> 00:05:33.730
No way! Yeah! (chuckles)

00:05:37.501 --> 00:05:39.398
Listen up, Mount Rageons.

00:05:39.533 --> 00:05:41.939
We are...

00:05:42.075 --> 00:05:43.405
frauds!

00:05:43.541 --> 00:05:46.007
(crowd gasping, murmuring)

00:05:46.142 --> 00:05:49.375
And we've been literally
torturing little trolls.

00:05:49.510 --> 00:05:50.743
(gasping)

00:05:50.878 --> 00:05:52.815
We just wanted to be famous.

00:05:52.950 --> 00:05:54.818
Honestly, my sister wanted
to be famous,

00:05:54.953 --> 00:05:57.417
and truly, I was too afraid
to stand up to her.

00:05:57.553 --> 00:05:58.987
(crowd murmuring)

00:05:59.123 --> 00:06:02.389
It's like I don't even know
who you are.

00:06:02.525 --> 00:06:03.856
Yeah, you do.

00:06:03.991 --> 00:06:05.792
And you asked me
to change anyway.

00:06:05.927 --> 00:06:08.864
Which isn't okay, family or not.

00:06:12.999 --> 00:06:14.905
Crimp, what are you doing?

00:06:15.875 --> 00:06:17.606
I was just saying
that I had a change of heart.

00:06:17.741 --> 00:06:19.474
You also engaged
in troll-napping,

00:06:19.609 --> 00:06:21.347
troll torture, fraud.

00:06:21.482 --> 00:06:22.915
(laughing):
It's just...

00:06:23.050 --> 00:06:24.176
And tax evasion.

00:06:24.312 --> 00:06:25.447
I'm gonna have to repossess
your yacht.

00:06:25.583 --> 00:06:28.218
Fair enough. Prison it is!

00:06:28.354 --> 00:06:30.021
Wow, this is liberating!

00:06:30.156 --> 00:06:31.682
(cheering)

00:06:31.818 --> 00:06:33.520
(Rhonda purrs)

00:06:33.656 --> 00:06:35.158
So, how you feeling?

00:06:35.293 --> 00:06:38.293
Happy, grateful,

00:06:38.428 --> 00:06:40.028
and really sorry

00:06:40.164 --> 00:06:42.495
that it's taken me this long
to open up to you.

00:06:42.630 --> 00:06:43.695
Whoa, TMI!

00:06:43.831 --> 00:06:45.137
Boundaries, my man.

00:06:45.273 --> 00:06:46.566
That is a lot of feelings.

00:06:46.701 --> 00:06:48.666
(both laughing)

00:06:48.801 --> 00:06:51.236
(crowd cheering)

